.git/
.github/
# EVERY .env variant: a credential baked into an image is published to
# everyone who can pull it.
.env
.env.*
*.bak
# A downloaded proxy list is a credential file, one login and password
# per line. The Dockerfile COPYs an explicit list rather than `COPY . .`,
# so this cannot get in today — but a defence that depends on nobody ever
# writing `COPY . .` is not a defence. Same narrow glob as .gitignore.
proxylist*.txt
*.log
*.key
secrets*
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.fingerprint_cache/
.venv/
venv/
env/
# Scrape output, dumps and research captures.
live/
recon/
captures/
canary.*
canary*.meta.json
*.latest_attempt.meta.json
*_debug.html
*_debug.png
*_p[0-9]*.html
